{"id":"4fb5cfb29c2f255e","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-hierarchical-truth-consistency.md","title":"有限分层真理的相对一致性","display":"thm-hierarchical-truth-consistency — 有限分层真理的相对一致性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-hierarchical-truth-consistency","aliases":["91-thm-hierarchical-truth-consistency","91-thm-Tarski-hierarchy-consistency","91-thm-hierarchical-consistency"],"display":"thm-hierarchical-truth-consistency — 有限分层真理的相对一致性","depends_on":["[[91-df-hierarchical-truth]]","[[91-df-typed-truth]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-hierarchical-truth-consistency"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-hierarchical-truth-consistency</span><span>91-thm-Tarski-hierarchy-consistency</span><span>91-thm-hierarchical-consistency</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-hierarchical-truth-consistency — 有限分层真理的相对一致性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8f93c57db760a2b7\" href=\"?note=8f93c57db760a2b7\" title=\"91-df-hierarchical-truth\">91-df-hierarchical-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"00a1e20ba65f1f5a\" href=\"?note=00a1e20ba65f1f5a\" title=\"91-df-typed-truth\">91-df-typed-truth</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> (一致的基础理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathcal B)\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathcal B)\\)</span> (基础理论一致)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TB}_i\">\\(\\mathrm{TB}_i\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_i\">\\(T_i\\)</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_i\">\\(\\mathcal L_i\\)</span> 句子的去引号实例集,\nsee <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8f93c57db760a2b7\" href=\"?note=8f93c57db760a2b7\" title=\"91-df-hierarchical-truth\">91-df-hierarchical-truth</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathcal L_n}\">\\(\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathcal L_n}\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_n\">\\(\\mathcal L_n\\)</span> 中的经典演绎闭包)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hierarchical\\text{-}truth\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{HierT}_n(\\mathcal B)\n\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathcal L_n}\n\\left(\n\\mathcal B\\cup\\bigcup_{i&lt;n}\\mathrm{TB}_i\n\\right),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hierarchical\\text{-}truth\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{HierT}_n(\\mathcal B)\n\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathcal L_n}\n\\left(\n\\mathcal B\\cup\\bigcup_{i&lt;n}\\mathrm{TB}_i\n\\right),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall n\\in\\omega\\,\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathcal B)\n\\to\n\\operatorname{Con}\\bigl(\\operatorname{HierT}_n(\\mathcal B)\\bigr)\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall n\\in\\omega\\,\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathcal B)\n\\to\n\\operatorname{Con}\\bigl(\\operatorname{HierT}_n(\\mathcal B)\\bigr)\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> 的模型，依次把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_i\">\\(T_i\\)</span> 解释为前一层语言在当前扩张中的\n满足集合，就得到有限层级的模型。每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TB}_i\">\\(\\mathrm{TB}_i\\)</span> 的实例域不含\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_i\">\\(T_i\\)</span>，故说谎者只能出现在更高层，不能触发同层透明矛盾。</p>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 或任意递归序数长度的统一层级，还必须指定序数表示、\n极限层语言、各阶段公理与归纳强度，并在足够的元理论中实施递归。\n因此不能从有限层论证无条件跳到\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HierT}_{\\omega_1^{CK}}\">\\(\\operatorname{HierT}_{\\omega_1^{CK}}\\)</span> 的一致性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-hierarchical-truth","status":"resolved","id":"8f93c57db760a2b7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-hierarchical-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-typed-truth","status":"resolved","id":"00a1e20ba65f1f5a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-typed-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-hierarchical-truth","status":"resolved","id":"8f93c57db760a2b7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TB}_i$ ($T_i$ 对 $\\mathcal L_i$ 句子的去引号实例集,\nsee [[91-df-hierarchical-truth]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathcal B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TB}_i","display":false},{"tex":"T_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathcal L_n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hierarchical\\text{-}truth\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{HierT}_n(\\mathcal B)\n\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathcal L_n}\n\\left(\n\\mathcal B\\cup\\bigcup_{i<n}\\mathrm{TB}_i\n\\right),","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall n\\in\\omega\\,\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathcal B)\n\\to\n\\operatorname{Con}\\bigl(\\operatorname{HierT}_n(\